<rml>
<head>
    <title>Pause</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="look.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="prefs.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="battle.rcss"/>
</head>
<!-- Port-only (SPEC-menus.md, "A pause menu"; the style frames' pause.rml and pause_mp.rml): over the battlefield, at
     the mission's interface size. Single player: PAUSED, the mission paused behind it, ABORT MISSION. Multiplayer: MENU,
     the battle plays on behind it, LEAVE MATCH. Beside the way on the settings changed mid-battle, each taking effect
     as it moves (logistics/MCPauseScreen makes their rows). -->
<body class="over-battle">
    <div class="veil light"></div>
    <div class="window-place">
        <div id="pause" class="panel glass">
            <div class="titlebar row bottom">
                <div class="grow"><div class="eyebrow" id="where"></div><div class="title caps" id="name">Paused</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pause-body">
                <div class="pause-actions">
                    <div class="button main wide tall" id="resume" data-first>Resume</div>
                    <div class="button wide" id="all">All preferences</div>
                    <div class="grow"></div>
                    <div class="button wide" id="leave">Abort mission</div>
                </div>
                <div class="quick" id="quick"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div id="hintbar">
        <div class="stage16">
            <div class="content">
                <div class="hints row"><div class="mouse-hints grow"></div><div class="keys"></div></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
